<title>MOLDOVA: SOCCER-ZIMBRU CHISINAU BEAT DNISTRU TO WIN MOLDOVAN CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZIMBRU CHISINAU BEAT DNISTRU TO WIN MOLDOVAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of Moldovan Cup final played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>    Zimbru Chisinau	 0    Dnistru Otaci   0</p>
<p>(After extra time. Zimbru won 8-7 on penalties)</p>
</text>
